<title>POLAND: INDYKPOL SEPT NET DOUBLES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>INDYKPOL SEPT NET DOUBLES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.70 vs   0.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.19 vs   0.40</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.41 vs   0.59</p>
<p> Sales		   15.93 vs  12.62</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.14 vs   1.62</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.45 vs   2.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.07 vs   3.35</p>
<p> Sales		  106.17 vs  80.00</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish poultry producer is Indykpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
